<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoBodyText3" align="left" style="margin-right: 45.4pt; text-align: left;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font style="">Hi</font><font color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> </font><span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">[</span><font color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp;</font></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#181818">&lt;insert contact name&gt; </font><span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">]</span></font></span><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">,</span></font></p>

<p class="MsoBodyText3" align="left" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-right: 45.4pt; text-align: left;"><span style="color: windowtext;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoBodyText3" align="left" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-right: 45.4pt; text-align: left;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: windowtext;">Thank
you for sharing an update about&nbsp;</span>{!Asset.Account}.<span style="color: red;">&nbsp;</span><span style="color: windowtext;">As we discussed, my
role is to routinely touch base with you to learn about any new developments
that may impact the level and quality of service that you receive from
Insperity. Your service team is always available to assist you with your human
resources needs, and I welcome your phone calls or emails alerting me to
changes in your business objectives that you feel may require additional
assistance from us.</span></font></p>

<p class="MsoBodyText3" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-right: 45.4pt;"><span style="color: windowtext;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoBodyText3" align="left" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-right: 45.4pt; text-align: left;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: windowtext;">In
the meantime, if you have any questions or concerns, please contact me by
calling my office at&nbsp;</span>{!User.Phone}<span style="color: windowtext;">. I
will contact you periodically to ensure you are receiving the caliber of
service from Insperity that you expect and to learn if any additional resources
may be of benefit to your company at that time.</span></font></p>

<p class="MsoBodyText3" align="left" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-right: 45.4pt; text-align: left;"><span style="color: red;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoBodyText3" align="left" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-right: 45.4pt; text-align: left;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">[</span> I have attached your updated Service Team Contact
Sheet for your records <span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">]</span>.</span></font></p>

<p class="MsoBodyText3" align="left" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-right: 45.4pt; text-align: left;"><b><span style="color: red;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="line-height: 107%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Thank you,</font><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>